From 87123b70cc2abf48e2541a0db5e93d159d97518c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:56:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/78] Port the spell effect engine (H085+$07B6) and the spell
 handlers

H085+$07B6 with saving throw (H062+$142C), attack roll ($12F6), damage
($2188, H063+$2984), effect application (H062+$0114), effect events
($083E, $057C, $0772, $17C0) and messages (H063+$2760); H063+$1B90.
About fifty spell handlers of H085 (Bless, Curse, Detect Magic,
Protection, Resist Cold/Fire, Shield, Sleep, Haste, Slow, Prayer, Remove
Curse, Cure Blindness, Fire Shield, Fumble, Confusion, ...) and the
H027 effect handlers $0286, $0A00, $3A46 and $41F6.  Combat-only
graphics and targeting (H029, H048, H049, H077, H063+$2178/$2BDE)
stay unported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
